# Two Abigale, Eloquent First-Year triggers on Bot2's Cecil, Dark Knight: it has two flying, two first strike and two lifelink
# counters, and each keyword once (CR 122.1b: a counter gives the object the keyword; several of a kind give it no more than
# one, and lifelink is redundant, CR 702.15f). On turn 6 Cecil attacks unblocked: Bot1 takes 2 and Bot2 gains 2, not 4.
# The second Abigale is Abigale's legend-rule twin (CR 704.5j): Bot1 keeps the first and the new one goes to the graveyard,
# its trigger still put on the stack.
# Turn 1: Swamp. Turn 3: Plains, the Moxes pay the first Abigale. Turn 5: Swamp and Plains pay the second.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Abigale, Eloquent First-Year
Abigale, Eloquent First-Year
Plains
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Cecil, Dark Knight
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Cecil, Dark Knight.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Abigale, Eloquent First-Year.Cast
Bot1.Target(Cecil, Dark Knight)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Abigale, Eloquent First-Year.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Battlefield.Abigale, Eloquent First-Year#1)
Bot1.Target(Cecil, Dark Knight)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Cecil, Dark Knight.Counters.Flying = 2
? Bot2.Battlefield.Cecil, Dark Knight.Counters.FirstStrike = 2
? Bot2.Battlefield.Cecil, Dark Knight.Counters.Lifelink = 2
[T6 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Cecil, Dark Knight > Bot1)
[T6 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 18
Bot2.Life = 22
Bot2.Battlefield.Cecil, Dark Knight.Keywords = FirstStrike; Flying; Lifelink
Bot1.Battlefield = Abigale, Eloquent First-Year; Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Plains; Swamp
Bot1.Graveyard = Abigale, Eloquent First-Year
